   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "LAYERS, MASKS & EFFECTS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 10, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Overlay\n   2 Blend mode\n   3 Cutout and green screen\n   4 Mask\n   5 Tracking\n   6 Video effect\n   7 Effect family\n   8 Copies of the picture\n   9 Light effect\n  10 Body effect\n  11 Superpower effect\n  12 Hallucination effect\n  13 Copies of a person\n  14 Outline and glow on a person\n  15 Glitch\n  16 Distortion\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 10, CC 65 to 80\n   1 Party flash\n   2 Stock clip\n   3 Generated shot\n   4 Side storyline\n   5 suite: Documentary\n   6 suite: Heavenly light\n   7 suite: Party edit\n   8 suite: Superhero moment\n   9 suite: Breakdown\n  10 suite: Trippy vision\n  11 pair: When impacts rise, the picture flashes\n  12 pair: When text labels something, it follows it\n  13 pair: When the feeling turns dreamlike, light blooms\n  14 pair: When the music is featured, the effects pulse on the beat\n  15 pair: When someone triumphs, their eyes light up\n  16 pair: When someone panics, the picture glitches\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 10, CC 81 to 84\n   1 pair: When the feeling turns dreamlike, the room spins\n   2 pair: When impacts rise, a shockwave flashes\n   3 pair: When the music is featured, the flashes hit the beat\n   4 pairs: Effects show the inside"
   },
